{
    "title": "Panda Mahjong - Classic Tile",
    "description": "Panda Mahjong is a relaxing tile-matching game that seamlessly combines classic mahjong with soothing gameplay. Immerse yourself in the tranquil beauty of this mahjong match, offering a peaceful escape from your busy routine.\r\n\r\nAs you progress through the game, remember to claim your complimentary mahjong rewards. Panda Mahjong is an engaging game that perfectly balances strategy and relaxation, catering to players of all skill levels.\r\n\r\nThe game's objective is simple: match open pairs of identical tiles and clear the board. With its captivating gameplay, Panda Mahjong has won the hearts of puzzle enthusiasts around the globe. Prepare for a classic mahjong solitaire adventure that will keep you coming back for more!\r\n\r\n\r\nHow To Play\r\n\r\n- Find the mahjong tiles with the same suit and pair them up!\r\n- Clear all the tuples to win the final victory!\r\n- Use a booster when you are having a hard time!\r\n\r\n\r\n<b>Features</b>\r\n\r\n\u2b50 Easy to pick up and play controls\r\n\u2b50 Multiple themes and backgrounds to choose from, free to change the look and style\r\n\u2b50 Automatic scaling\r\n\u2b50 No timer, no pressure\r\n\u2b50 Turn sound on or off\r\n\u2b50 No problem without Wifi! You can also play offline if you wish.\r\n\r\n\r\nWith thousands of mahjong puzzles in various layouts and stunning graphics, this game is sure to keep you entertained for hours. If you love playing classic mahjong games, puzzle games, match games, or other board games, Panda Mahjong  is the perfect game for you!",
    "descriptionHTML": "Panda Mahjong is a relaxing tile-matching game that seamlessly combines classic mahjong with soothing gameplay. Immerse yourself in the tranquil beauty of this mahjong match, offering a peaceful escape from your busy routine.<br><br>As you progress through the game, remember to claim your complimentary mahjong rewards. Panda Mahjong is an engaging game that perfectly balances strategy and relaxation, catering to players of all skill levels.<br><br>The game&#39;s objective is simple: match open pairs of identical tiles and clear the board. With its captivating gameplay, Panda Mahjong has won the hearts of puzzle enthusiasts around the globe. Prepare for a classic mahjong solitaire adventure that will keep you coming back for more!<br><br><br>How To Play<br><br>- Find the mahjong tiles with the same suit and pair them up!<br>- Clear all the tuples to win the final victory!<br>- Use a booster when you are having a hard time!<br><br><br><b>Features</b><br><br>\u2b50 Easy to pick up and play controls<br>\u2b50 Multiple themes and backgrounds to choose from, free to change the look and style<br>\u2b50 Automatic scaling<br>\u2b50 No timer, no pressure<br>\u2b50 Turn sound on or off<br>\u2b50 No problem without Wifi! You can also play offline if you wish.<br><br><br>With thousands of mahjong puzzles in various layouts and stunning graphics, this game is sure to keep you entertained for hours. If you love playing classic mahjong games, puzzle games, match games, or other board games, Panda Mahjong  is the perfect game for you!",
    "summary": "The relaxing fun & puzzles! Play the classic mahjong solitaire now!",
